   "en": "I'd like the same again on the next sortie.",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "vo0_of0_369",
   "en": "Now then, a victory party, just us girls!",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "vo0_of1_369",
   "en": "You really are spirited. I envy you.",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "vo0_of2_369",
   "en": "Your flying was so brilliant I was spellbound. Wonderful.",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "vo0_om0_369",
   "en": "Heh, no need to worry after all. Bad habit of mine.",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
